# Build context is the repo ROOT. Include source/config/entrypoint plus root
# license texts and qeli/third-party-notices/rust legal resources. Exclude everything heavy so
# the context transfer (and `docker save` for routers) stays small.
**/target
.git
.github
release/dist
release/keenetic
release/prod-client-configs
**/*.apk
**/*.deb
**/*.tar
**/build
site
qeli-android
qeli-win
qeli-mac
qeli-shared
docs
**/node_modules
**/.gradle
**/.idea
